{"id":"MOEX-113020-1301-Q087","title":"葡萄糖到乳酸淨得2 ATP，NADH由LDH用回去","version":"accepted","batch":"113-1-med1","sourceSha256":"311766a008de4cd486451d5cf3ace651e21626ab07aac13eb730273a6bb8da80","sourceLibraryId":"libfile_b848a20b2aa881918b9ed1a6290c803d","sourceAnchor":"q87","shortHtml":"<p>答案為 <strong>B：淨產生兩莫耳ATP</strong>。題目終點是<strong>乳酸</strong>，因此必須把糖解產生的NADH，與乳酸生成消耗的NADH合併計算；最後<strong>NADH淨增加量為0</strong>。</p>","html":"<div><h2>葡萄糖到乳酸淨得2 ATP，NADH由LDH用回去</h2><p class=\"reviewed-official-answer\">官方最終採計：B</p><p>答案為 <strong>B：淨產生兩莫耳ATP</strong>。題目終點是<strong>乳酸</strong>，因此必須把糖解產生的NADH，與乳酸生成消耗的NADH合併計算；最後<strong>NADH淨增加量為0</strong>。</p>\n<h3>分開記兩本帳：ATP與還原當量</h3>\n<figure><span class=\"reviewed-image-frame\" data-image-state=\"loading\" style=\"--reviewed-image-width:834px;--reviewed-image-ratio:1.3322683706070289\"><img src=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/d268a49a2ca3c970d1f35807cca733154f9725dbecacbcfb85cfa2a875c84fc8.png\" alt=\"糖解的能量投資與回收\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"834\" height=\"626\"></span><a class=\"reviewed-image-link\" href=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/d268a49a2ca3c970d1f35807cca733154f9725dbecacbcfb85cfa2a875c84fc8.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">放大查看原圖</a><figcaption>左側先投入2 ATP，分叉後共產生4 ATP及2 NADH；糖解至丙酮酸的淨收益為2 ATP。 圖：OpenStax／Rice University；圖：A. Rao、K. Ryan，Texas A&amp;M University Department of Biology；<a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CC BY-NC-SA 4.0</a>；<a href=\"https://openstax.org/books/biology-2e/pages/7-2-glycolysis\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">原圖來源</a>。完整原圖；未裁切、改標、重畫或拼接。</figcaption></figure>\n<div class=\"reviewed-table-scroll\"><table><thead><tr><th>每1莫耳葡萄糖</th><th>ATP變化</th><th>NADH變化</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr><td>糖解前段的兩次磷酸化投資</td><td>−2</td><td>0</td></tr>\n<tr><td>兩個三碳分子完成產能後段</td><td>＋4</td><td>＋2</td></tr>\n<tr><td>2丙酮酸還原成2乳酸</td><td>0</td><td>−2</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>全程淨變化</strong></td><td><strong>＋2 ATP</strong></td><td><strong>0 NADH</strong></td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n<p>葡萄糖裂解後形成<strong>兩個三碳分子</strong>，所以後段兩個能產生ATP的反應，各執行兩次，合計生成4 ATP；扣除前段投資的2 ATP，淨得2 ATP。這些ATP來自<strong>受質層級磷酸化</strong>，不是電子傳遞鏈的氧化磷酸化。</p>\n<h3>乳酸生成的重點，是把NAD⁺再生回來</h3>\n<p><strong>乳酸去氫酶（lactate dehydrogenase，LDH）</strong>催化丙酮酸接受NADH提供的還原當量，轉成乳酸；NADH則轉回NAD⁺。因此每形成1莫耳乳酸消耗1莫耳NADH，本題形成2莫耳乳酸，正好用掉糖解產生的2莫耳NADH。</p>\n<p>再生的NAD⁺可供糖解中的<strong>甘油醛-3-磷酸去氫酶</strong>繼續使用。如果只累積NADH而沒有足夠NAD⁺，這一步會受限，糖解也難以持續。LDH本身<strong>不另外產生ATP</strong>。</p>\n<figure><span class=\"reviewed-image-frame\" data-image-state=\"loading\" style=\"--reviewed-image-width:1500px;--reviewed-image-ratio:1.3333333333333333\"><img src=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/146d3d688147628918635e92be0cb0919c948fa27888bf02384a2498da3aa13a.png\" alt=\"乳酸生成讓NAD⁺再生\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1500\" height=\"1125\"></span><a class=\"reviewed-image-link\" href=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/146d3d688147628918635e92be0cb0919c948fa27888bf02384a2498da3aa13a.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">放大查看原圖</a><figcaption>丙酮酸轉成乳酸時消耗NADH並再生NAD⁺，因此全程不淨累積NADH。 圖：OpenStax／Rice University；圖：A. Rao、K. Ryan、A. Tag、S. Fletcher，Texas A&amp;M University Department of Biology；<a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CC BY-NC-SA 4.0</a>；<a href=\"https://openstax.org/books/biology-2e/pages/7-5-metabolism-without-oxygen\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">原圖來源</a>。完整原圖；未裁切、改標、重畫或拼接。</figcaption></figure>\n<p>上圖綠箭頭是<strong>葡萄糖→兩個丙酮酸</strong>，此段產生淨2 ATP；下方橙箭頭把兩個丙酮酸轉成兩個乳酸。中央白色循環顯示<strong>NAD⁺→NADH→NAD⁺</strong>的再生，ATP收益只畫在糖解段。因此把兩段相加，NADH的產生與消耗互相抵消。</p>\n<h3>為什麼D看起來很熟，仍然不對？</h3>\n<p><strong>2 ATP＋2 NADH</strong>是「葡萄糖經糖解到丙酮酸」的常見淨帳目；D漏算了題目接著指定的<strong>丙酮酸→乳酸</strong>。A與C則把ATP淨值少算成1，C還同時漏扣NADH。</p>\n<p>本題從<strong>游離葡萄糖</strong>起算，不是從肌糖原磷酸解取得的葡萄糖殘基起算；也不需要把肝臟將乳酸再製成葡萄糖的成本加進來。另須知道，乳酸並非只能在完全沒有氧氣時形成，但這不影響題目指定路徑的能量帳目。</p>\n<details><summary>原題、答鍵與查核來源</summary><ul><li><a href=\"https://wwwq.moex.gov.tw/exam/wHandExamQandA_File.ashx?c=301&amp;code=113020&amp;q=1&amp;s=11&amp;t=Q\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">考選部：113年第一次醫學（一）原題，第87題</a></li><li><a href=\"https://wwwq.moex.gov.tw/exam/wHandExamQandA_File.ashx?c=301&amp;code=113020&amp;q=1&amp;s=11&amp;t=S\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">考選部：初始標準答案</a></li><li><a href=\"https://wwwq.moex.gov.tw/exam/wHandExamQandA_File.ashx?c=301&amp;code=113020&amp;q=1&amp;s=11&amp;t=M\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">考選部：更正後答案</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK26882/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Alberts et al., Molecular Biology of the Cell: How Cells Obtain Energy from Food</a></li><li><a href=\"https://openstax.org/books/biology-2e/pages/7-2-glycolysis\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">OpenStax／Rice University；圖：A. Rao、K. Ryan，Texas A&amp;M University Department of Biology：糖解的能量投資與回收</a></li><li><a href=\"https://openstax.org/books/biology-2e/pages/7-5-metabolism-without-oxygen\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">OpenStax／Rice University；圖：A. Rao、K. Ryan、A. Tag、S. Fletcher，Texas A&amp;M University Department of Biology：乳酸生成讓NAD⁺再生</a></li></ul></details></div>","imageCount":2,"sourceAnswer":"官方最終採計：B"}